We've also created a `NavBar` component that uses `NavLink` from `react-router-dom` to render the navigation links. The `activeClassName` prop is used to add a CSS class to the active link.

Finally, we've defined the routes in the `App` component using `Route` from `react-router-dom` and wrapped the whole app with `BrowserRouter`.

