To optimize the code to have a time complexity of O(log n) and space complexity of O(1), we can implement a binary search algorithm. Instead of dividing the list into two halves and recursively searching each half, we can compare the middle element with the target value and narrow down the search space to either the left or right half. This reduces the time complexity from O(n) to O(log n).

Here is the modified code:

