Here's a PHP code snippet that can be used to get the root directory of the server without using the mentioned built-in functions:

```php
<?php
function getRootDirectory() {
    $scriptPath = str_replace('\\', '/', __FILE__);
    $scriptName = str_replace('\\', '/', $_SERVER['SCRIPT_FILENAME']);

    // Find the position of the script name in the script path
    $pos = strpos($scriptPath, $scriptName);

    // Extract the root directory
    $rootPath = substr($scriptPath, 0, $pos);

    return $rootPath;
}

