The `mergeSort` method recursively divides the list of strings into smaller sublists until there's only one element in each sublist. Then it merges the sublists in a sorted manner using the `merge` method.

The `merge` method compares the strings based on their unique character counts. If the unique character counts are the same, it compares the lengths of the strings.

