```java
public class AdditionWithoutOperator {
    public static int add(int a, int b) {
        while (b != 0) {
            int carry = (a & b) << 1;
            a = a ^ b;
            b = carry;
        }
        return a;
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int a = 2;
        int b = 3;
        int sum = add(a, b);
        System.out.println("Sum: " + sum);
    }
}
```

Output:
