- If the current character is a letter, we check if it needs to be capitalized or not. If it needs to be capitalized (i.e., `capitalizeNext` is true), we append the uppercase version of the character to the result and set `capitalizeNext` to false. Otherwise, we append the lowercase version of the character to the result.
