Otherwise, the array is divided into two halves and the `findMaxMin` function is called recursively on each half. The maximum and minimum elements of the two halves are obtained, and the maximum of these two is the maximum element of the entire array. Similarly, the minimum of these two is the minimum element of the entire array.

