To ensure accessibility for screen readers, we set the `aria-label` attribute to "Redirect to " + the URL. This attribute provides an accessible label for the button, describing its purpose.

Finally, we return the `outerHTML` property of the button element, which gives us the complete HTML code for the button tag.

